<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">HulluEdit: Single-Pass Evidence-Consistent Subspace Editing for Mitigating Hallucinations in Large Vision-Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
