<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">MME fine-grained evaluation. HulluEdit improves object recognition (Existence, Position, Color) while trading off Count performance, supporting the separation of visual and language priors.</span></figcaption>
